notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-20T20:29:47.551Z",codex,"TDD receipt: the real wrapper delegated pm close so it persisted, then returned exit 4. The new regression was red because both markers remained on the closed tombstone and is green after the evidence-based status recheck."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-20T20:29:47.551Z",codex,"A mutation receipt and mutation state are independent evidence. After an ambiguous receipt, recovery should query authoritative state and branch only on exact positive evidence."
