close_reason: "Greptile P1 fixed with a real post-apply exit-4 race regression. npm run release:check passes 173 tests at exact 100.00/100.00/100.00 coverage, 63 documented declarations, zero clones, zero production vulnerabilities, clean packaging, and current changelog."
